{"id":"vod_bf_35094","vodId":"35094","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"妄想学生会第二季","name_cn":"妄想学生会第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第25集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-36/bd695d23d89970dad319aebfd46e3503.jpg"},"summary":"私立樱才学园本是一所女子高校，然而，在社会大趋势的冲击之下，校方决定打开大门，迎接男生们的到来。第一年，学校录取的男生仅有区区二十八人，他们所要面对的，是泱泱五百二十四位“如狼似虎”的女生们。津田隆利（浅沼晋太郎 配音）就是这二十八人中的一员，机缘巧合之下，他误打误撞加入了学生会之中。　　外表端庄秀丽，却有着极大脑洞和极强妄想能力的学生会会长天草筱（日笠阳子 配音）、个性成熟可靠但有时候会语出惊人的七条天空（佐藤聪美 配音）、智商超哥但个性如同小学生一样傲娇的荻村铃（矢作纱友里 配音），在三位古灵精怪的女孩子的陪伴下，津田的校园生活正式拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:30:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wangxiangxueshenghuidierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url